# Tekko NGN (permanent VA collect + bank payout)

Transacty offers **NGN** to merchants; Tekko is the rail. Merchants use Transacty APIs/wallets — not Tekko directly.

## Product locks (docs scan 2026-09-02)

- **Collect model:** one **permanent customer NGN VA per Transacty merchant** (`POST/GET …/customers/:id/ng/virtual-account*`). Reusable bank details; any inbound amount. **Not** exact-amount temporary collections for the merchant product.
- **BVN:** Platform **BVN Basic** only (`POST …/bvn/verify`) — **never** send `faceImage`. Poll `GET …/bvn/status` if `pending`. Do **not** store raw BVN at rest.
- **Tekko credit target:** customer NGN sub-ledger → map `endUserId` via `merchants.tekko_customer_id` → credit Transacty **NGN** pocket on `customer.wallet.credited`.
- **Transacty settlement:** native **NGN** merchant pocket. No auto-swap to USDT/USDC. Do **not** credit Europe `USDC` or `PYUSD-USDC`.
- **Payout:** `POST /master-wallet/ng/withdraw` (master ledger). Customer VA deposits and master withdraw are different Tekko ledgers — fail closed on insufficient master balance; confirm Tekko liquidity/sweep with ops before go-live.
- **Out of scope:** MoMo KE/UG, swaps, Waverlite, face capture, shared master VA as merchant product.
- **Live-only:** same Tekko Platform credential model as PYUSD (no sandbox). `test` fails closed.
- **Entitlement:** Tekko partner must have `ngn_collections` (VA) and `ngn_payouts` (withdraw) or calls return `403 SERVICE_NOT_ENTITLED`.

## Isolation

- Adapter: `services/integrations/tekko/ngn-va.ts` (+ legacy `ngn-collect.ts` drain only). Do **not** fold into `pyusd-payin.ts`.
- Do **not** edit `services/integrations/tylt/**`, `services/domestic/**` PayOK, or implement Waverlite for this work.
- Leave [`.cursor/rules/50-waverlite-ngn.mdc`](50-waverlite-ngn.mdc) as historical study notes only; NGN product path is **Tekko**.
- Webhook entry shares `POST /webhooks/tekko/:environment`. Reuse Tekko client, Ed25519 sign, static proxy, webhook HMAC secret — same env as PYUSD.

## Surfaces

| Area | Path |
|------|------|
| Market | `nigeria` settles `["NGN"]` |
| Provider id | `tekko-ngn-va` (pay-in), `tekko-ngn-payout` (pay-out); legacy `tekko-ngn-collect` read-only drain |
| Merchant HMAC | `GET/POST /v1/ngn/virtual-account`, `POST/GET /v1/ngn/payouts`, `GET /v1/ngn/banks`, `POST /v1/ngn/verify-account` |
| Portal JWT | `/portal/me/ngn/virtual-account`, payouts, banks + verify |
| Webhooks | VA credit on `customer.wallet.credited` (NGN + endUserId); payout on `withdrawal.*` |
| Tekko APIs | BVN Basic + customer VA onboard/GET; master `ng/withdraw` |

## Ops

Confirm `ngn_collections` + `ngn_payouts` with Tekko. Checklist: `docs/TEKKO_NGN_OPS_ENTITLEMENT.md`. Probe: `npm run tekko:ngn-entitlement-check`.
